CREATED:20260930T143954Z
DESCRIPTION:November 30. 2026. Fredric Jameson Gallery. \nGUEST TALK. BLAC
 K COTTON U.S.\nFeaturing Julius Tillery. For five generations\, the Tille
 ry family has worked the land of Northeastern NC. Black Cotton U.S. asks 
 us to look at the familiar crop - to see beyond the commodity and conside
 r the history\, labor\, beauty\, and lives connected to it. Join us as Ju
 lius shares his story and invites us into a conversation about cotton\, l
 and\, family\, and the future of farming.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20261117T170133Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261130T170000
LAST-MODIFIED:20261117T170133Z
