DESCRIPTION:Ready to shape the future of digital health\, AI\, and clinica
 l innovation? \n\nThe Master of Management in Clinical Informatics (MMCi)
  at Duke University School of Medicine prepares healthcare professionals\
 , students\, early-career talent\, IT professionals and industry innovato
 rs to turn data into action and technology into meaningful patient impact
 .\n \nWhy MMCi?\n \n✅ Earn your master's degree in just 12 months through
  a flexible hybrid format that lets you continue working while you learn.
 \n✅ Learn from health industry leaders and gain practical skills in clini
 cal informatics\, healthcare analytics\, digital transformation\, AI\, an
 d healthcare management.\n✅ Join a diverse network of physicians\, clinic
 ians\, healthcare professionals\, business leaders\, and technology innov
 ators working together to solve real-world healthcare challenges.\n✅ Adva
 nce your career with graduates reporting significant salary growth and ex
 panded leadership opportunities across healthcare\, life sciences\, consu
 lting\, technology\, and digital health.\n \nWho Should Attend?\n 	\n• He
 althcare professionals seeking leadership roles in digital health\n• Busi
 ness\, data\, and IT professionals looking to make an impact in healthcar
 e\n• Recent undergrad students and early-career professionals interested 
 in healthcare technology and digital health\n• Anyone passionate about te
 chnology and innovation to improve patient care\, streamline provider wor
 kflow and increase access to healthcare\n\nJoin Our MMCi Program Overview
  Session\n \nDiscover how Duke's MMCi program can help you develop the le
 adership\, business\, and informatics skills needed to thrive in today's 
 rapidly evolving healthcare landscape. Learn about the curriculum\, caree
 r outcomes\, admissions process\, and hear how our graduates are transfor
 ming healthcare organizations.\n \nRegister today to learn how MMCi can h
 elp you become a leader in the future of digital health and clinical info
 rmatics: https://duke.zoom.us/j/92037554610?jst=1\n\nTransform Your Caree
 r. Transform Health Care.
DURATION:PT1H
