DESCRIPTION:Join this December 1st virtual meeting at 4 PM to learn about 
 the Physician-Scientist "Strong Start" program and hear directly from Str
 ong Start scholars how the program supported their journey to independenc
 e. The panelists\, as well as Program Director\, Surdarshan Rajagopal\, w
 ill answer your questions about the Strong Start application\, which will
  close on Feburary 1st\, 2027.\n\nPhysician-Scientist Strong Start Townha
 ll (December 1\, 2026) Panel discussion with current Strong Start Awardee
 s:\n\nMara Serbanescu\, MD\; Assistant Professor of Anesthesiology\nGeorg
 e Albert Cortina\, MD\; Assistant Professor of Anesthesiology\nTarannum J
 aleel\, MD\; Associate Professor of Dermatology\nJoshua Parsons\, MD\, Ph
 D\; Assistant Professor of Medicine
