DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with the Duke Chorale and special guests 
 from Durham School of the Arts in a joyful\, family-friendly concert at D
 uke Chapel.\n\nFeaturing lullabies\, carols\, and seasonal music from Sou
 th Africa\, Argentina\, Mexico\, England\, the United States\, and beyond
 \, the program explores themes of joy\, light\, and hope during the darke
 st time of the year. With the magnificent sound of the Chapel organ\, a s
 pecial visitor\, and a small gift for children\, this festive performance
  offers something for audiences of all ages.\n\nThis event is free and op
 en to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H15M
