DESCRIPTION:Experience the artistry\, collaboration\, and expressive range
  of Duke student musicians during the second and final night of this two-
 concert chamber music series.\n\nFeaturing performers from the Duke Chamb
 er Music Program\, "Chamber Music at Duke: Concert 2" highlights the clos
 e musical dialogue and shared creativity at the heart of chamber music. \
 n\nAdditional program details will be announced soon.\n\nThis event is fr
 ee and open to the public. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT1H
