CREATED:20261109T164315Z
DESCRIPTION:Title of Presentation:\n"Facial Transplantation:  A Journey Of
  Innovation\, Collaboration\, And Transformation"\n\nSpeaker:\nSamir Mard
 ini\, M.D.\nProfessor and Chairman\, Department of Plastic and Reconstruc
 tive Surgery \nGeorgetown University\nPhysician Executive Director\, MedS
 tar Medical Group\nSystem Chief\, Plastic Surgery\, MedStar Health\nEmeri
 tus Professor of Surgery and Anatomy\nMayo Clinic College of Medicine\n\n
 \nThis talk will be recorded and made available for on-demand viewing. Pl
 ease visit our website linked below for access.\n\nThe mission of Surgery
  Grand Rounds is to provide an educational format that has a broad appeal
  to Duke faculty\, residents\, staff\, and students. Grand Rounds consist
 s of a broad range of topics that are presented by local\, regional\, and
  international speakers on clinical education\, research science\, and de
 velopments in technology\, and also addresses other related issues that m
 ay affect our current and future surgeons. Physicians who attend Surgery 
 Grand Rounds are eligible to receive CME credit.\n\nFor more information\
 , please visit our website by clicking on MORE EVENT INFORMATION below
DURATION:PT1H
