DESCRIPTION:The 4th Annual Maixner Pain Research Symposium\, in honor of t
 he late Dr. William "Bill" Maixner\, is co-hosted this year by the Compar
 ative Pain Research and Education Center at NC State University and the D
 epartment of Anesthesiology at Duke University. This event brings togethe
 r pain researchers and clinicians from North Carolina academic hubs\, inc
 luding Duke University\, UNC-Chapel Hill\, NC State University\, and Wake
  Forest University\, to 1) share exciting new advances in pain research a
 nd pain management\, 2) stimulate organic collaborative opportunities\, a
 nd 3) promote professional development of early career students and train
 ees.
DURATION:PT8H30M
