DESCRIPTION:This session will cover general strategies and best practices 
 on how to review grants\, including how to cover review of specific secti
 ons (i.e.\, Approach\, Significance and Innovation)\, what is helpful for
  the study section Chair and committee\, what is not helpful or common mi
 stakes.\n\nRegister: https://ctsi.wakehealth.edu/education-and-training/s
 earch-educational-offerings/b/biostatistics-epidemiology-and-research-des
 ign-berd-lunch-and-learn-series\n\nThis event is being cross-promoted by 
 the NC BERD Consortium\, a collaboration of the CTSA-funded BERD cores at
  UNC-Chapel Hill\, Wake Forest University School of Medicine\, and Duke U
 niversity School of Medicine.
DURATION:PT1H
